<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis 1996 results in detail.</title>
<headline>Fortis 1996 results in detail.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(millions of ECUs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS GROUP --</p>
<p>INSURANCE</p>
<p>	-- Life operating profit	   413  vs   341</p>
<p>	-- Non-life operating profit     115  vs    82</p>
<p>	-- Other operating profits	 212  vs   213</p>
<p>	-- Total operating profit	  740  vs   636</p>
<p>	-- Capital gains		     176  vs    92</p>
<p>	-- Exceptional items	charge 116  vs    45  charge</p>
<p>BANKING</p>
<p>     -- Net interest income	    1,554  vs 1,369</p>
<p>     -- Net commission income	    188  vs   188</p>
<p>     -- Other income			 405  vs   379</p>
<p>     -- Charges			    1,628  vs 1,403</p>
<p>     -- Operating profit		   519  vs   533</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis is a banking and insurance group jointly owned by Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
